    'legal.privacy.html': `<h3>1. Data Controller</h3><p>The Data Controller is <strong>GSA Hotels S.r.l.</strong>, based in Italy. For any privacy-related request, you can contact us at: <a href="mailto:info@gsahotels.com">info@gsahotels.com</a>.</p><h3>2. Types of Data Collected</h3><p>We collect data for business and strategic partnership purposes:</p><ul><li><strong>Contact Data:</strong> Name, business email, phone, hotel name (via form).</li><li><strong>Technical Data:</strong> IP address, browsing data and preferences (via cookies).</li></ul><h3>3. Purpose and Legal Basis</h3><p>Your data is processed for:</p><ul><li>Managing affiliation requests and asset evaluation (Pre-contractual execution).</li><li>Commercial communications related to GSA services (Legitimate interest).</li><li>Administrative and fiscal legal obligations.</li></ul><h3>4. Data Retention</h3><p>Data will be retained for the time strictly necessary to manage your request or for the duration of the business relationship, unless otherwise required by law.</p><h3>5. Your Rights (GDPR)</h3><p>You have the right to access your data, request rectification, deletion or restriction of processing at any time by contacting the Data Controller.</p><p class="legal-footer-note">Last updated: January 2026</p>`,
