    'legal.cookie.html': `<h3>1. Use of Cookies</h3><p>This site uses cookies to improve the browsing experience and analyze traffic. We manage cookies through the proprietary <em>GSA Cookie Engine</em> system.</p><h3>2. Types</h3><ul><li><strong>Technical:</strong> Necessary for operation (e.g., remembering if you accepted cookies).</li><li><strong>Analytics:</strong> (Google Analytics) Used for anonymous statistics. Active only with your consent.</li><li><strong>Marketing:</strong> (Meta/LinkedIn Pixel) Used for targeted advertising campaigns. Active only with your consent.</li></ul><h3>3. Your Rights</h3><p>You can revoke consent at any time by deleting cookies from your browser or using the "Manage Preferences" button (if available).</p><p class="legal-footer-note">Last updated: January 2026</p>`,
